{"id":69845719683881,"type":"album","name":"Public Strain","artist":"Women","year":2010,"weight":14,"info":{"cover":"https://cdn2.albumoftheyear.org/600x0/album/public-strain.jpg","aoty":78,"aoty_user":80,"sputnik":3.97,"yt":"Ymq7MwYsxwA","links":{"rateyourmusic":"https://rateyourmusic.com/release/album/women/public-strain","aoty":"https://www.albumoftheyear.org/album/1961-women-public-strain.php","sputnikmusic":"https://www.sputnikmusic.com/album/59688/Women-Public-Strain/"},"desc":"On their debut self-titled album, Women embraced sonic brashness that deeper examination revealed to be tinted with sly pop melody. With Public Strain the band honed a sound truthful to that reverb drenched noise while allowing the pop sensibilities to surface into clearer focus. From the opening strains of \"Can't You See\" it's clear that the album is far more than just a continuation of their debut. Resting upon a plodding bass line, deadpan vocal delivery, and bowed guitars and cello, this moody, nocturnal ballad opens the album on a dark note – one that is quickly countered by \"Heat ."},"artist_ref":{"id":37178174344178,"name":"Women","info":{"img":null}},"labels":[],"genres":[{"id":210192360016800,"type":"genre","name":"Alternative Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2664,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":31482837869539,"type":"genre","name":"Punk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":2333,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":8412226417108,"type":"genre","name":"Indie Rock","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":1139,"yt":null,"src":"rym"},{"id":226054802434556,"type":"genre","name":"Post-Punk","artist":null,"year":null,"weight":755,"yt":null,"src":"rym"}],"lists":[{"id":182218712006755,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Post-Punk","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":62,"year":null,"note":null,"total":200,"scaruffi":null},{"id":89365250498738,"name":"RYM Top — Rock — Indie Rock","src":"musthear","grp":"rateyourmusic","list_year":null,"rank":109,"year":null,"note":null,"total":